# Check the code before guessing

When the user reports an error, read the code path that handles that action before stating a cause. Do not open with a guess about deploy state, environment variables, or a missing rebuild.

Name the function or write path that produced the result, then fix that code.

```text
User: 维修单图片不在桶里
❌ "Cloud Run 可能还没重新部署"
✅ Open the photo upload function, see it writes to local disk, then change that write
```
